      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you add a brief comment here that summarizes Kaylee\u0027s CL comment from https://skia-review.git.corp.google.com/c/skia/+/1279236, since that appears to be when this pattern showed up in `isValid()` below and it caused me a bit of a double-take.",
